abstract: >
  Replication package for the paper "Failure-Directed Data Curation for
  Few-Shot Reaction Product Prediction: In-Domain Gains under Protocol
  Fidelity without Cross-Split Generalization" (Li et al., 2026).
  Includes the v9_g1prime dataset (46 train / 97 eval), clean hold-out
  set (n=31, reaction-key-disjoint), locked recipe configuration
  (Qwen2.5-7B + LoRA, bf16), and all training / evaluation / mechanism
  validation scripts.
keywords:
  - recursive self-improvement
  - data-centric AI
  - failure-directed curation
  - few-shot learning
  - chemical reaction prediction
  - evaluation integrity
